# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Remove XCM v3

doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      XCM v3 has been removed. The minimum supported XCM version is now v4 and the
      `xcm::v3` module, the `V3` variants of every `Versioned*` type (`VersionedXcm`,
      `VersionedLocation`, `VersionedAssets`, `VersionedAssetId`, ...), the `AlwaysV3`
      version wrapper and the `VersionedLocatableAsset::V3` variant are gone. The
      `Error`, `SendError`, `XcmHash`, `BodyId`, `BodyPart`, `GetWeight`, `OriginKind`,
      `WeightLimit`, `MaybeErrorCode` and `MaxDispatchErrorLen` definitions that v4 and
      v5 re-exported from v3 now live in `xcm::v4`.

      Wire compatibility for v4 and v5 is unchanged: the SCALE variant indices are
      explicit and stay at 4 and 5. Anything still encoded with the v3 discriminant
      can no longer be decoded, so before upgrading to this release a chain must:
      - have run `pallet_xcm::migration::MigrateToLatestXcmVersion` on a previous
        runtime, so no `Queries`, `LockedFungibles`, `RemoteLockedFungibles` or
        version-tracking entries remain at v3;
      - migrate any of its own storage that holds `xcm::v3` types or `V3` variants of
        the versioned types (asset registries keyed by `xcm::v3::MultiLocation`,
        `pallet-asset-rate` and treasury spends keyed by
        `VersionedLocatableAsset::V3`, and similar).
      Assets trapped under a v3 hash can no longer be claimed, and destinations that
      only speak XCM v3 become unreachable: `wrap_version` fails with
      `DestinationUnsupported` for them.

      Metadata type paths change for the types moved out of v3 (for example
      `xcm::v3::traits::Error` becomes `xcm::v4::traits::Error`), which renames the
      corresponding generated types in client-side descriptors.

crates:
  - name: staging-xcm
    bump: major
  - name: xcm-procedural
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-xcm
    bump: major
  - name: polkadot-runtime-common
    bump: major
  - name: parachains-common
    bump: major
  - name: staging-xcm-builder
    bump: none
  - name: pallet-xcm-precompiles
    bump: none
  - name: xcm-runtime-apis
    bump: none
  - name: asset-hub-rococo-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: snowbridge-pallet-inbound-queue
    bump: none
  - name: cumulus-pallet-xcmp-queue
    bump: none
  - name: pallet-contracts-uapi
    bump: none
